msgctxt "268"
msgid "Sorry, but I don't think I can help you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"It's okay. I should have thought things through before buying all this ice "
"cream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"We can still share these last two cones, at least. I'm sorry to have "
"troubled you with such an unreasonable request."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "You got 100 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Your family's waiting for you, right? I'll buy some replacement ice cream "
"and bring it to them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "You would? Thank you! Good luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>1,200 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Damn... Seems I'm a little short."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Sorry. Looks like I can't help you after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"It's okay. I should have thought things through before buying all this ice "
"cream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"We can still share these last two cones, at least. I'm sorry to have "
"troubled you with such an unreasonable request."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "You got 100 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Excuse me sir! Please, come over here for a moment!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Are you talking to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "Yes, you! Please, I need your help!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "What's the problem?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"I was hoping to treat my family to some ice cream, so I bought some from "
"that shop over there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"But four six-scoop specials is far more than I can carry by myself, and now "
"they look like they're starting to melt!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid ""
"I know I shouldn't be asking a complete stranger, but please, would you "
"help me carry them? I'm begging you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "Sorry, but you'll have to ask someone else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"Oh... I understand... I know that was a strange request. Sorry for "
"bothering you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "Seems like you could really use some help. Sure, I'll lend a hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "Oh, thank you so much! You're much nicer than you look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "So where do you want me to take these?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid ""
"Ah, right. Just bring them up the street to the convenience store over "
"there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "They were 1,200 yen a pair, so please be careful with them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "All right. I'll get them to the convenience store before they melt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid ""
"Deliver the ice cream to the man's family. Be careful not to run or bump "
"into passersby, or you'll drop it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid ""
"Think of how happy the family will be when you deliver their delicious "
"six-scoop ice cream cones to them outside the convenience store!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid ""
"Oh, it's you again! Please, can you spare a moment? I still need someone to "
"help me carry this ice cream!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid ""
"I've tried asking other people since you left, but everyone else was too "
"busy. Now it's really started melting, and it's getting everywhere!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid ""
"I'll pay you for your troubles. All I'm asking is that you carry a couple "
"of ice cream cones! Please, won't you help me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "Sorry, but you'll have to ask someone else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid "Oh man... What am I supposed to dooo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid "Help Him"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid "Refuse"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "Help Him"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "Refuse"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7808"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7812"
msgid "Kind Father"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7816"
msgid "Talk_Quest"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7820"
msgid "Talk_No"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7824"
msgid "Talk_Yes"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7828"
msgid "Carry the Ice Cream!"
msgstr ""